<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>The cows eat grass,</l><l>The cars need gas, (beep beep beep)</l><l>The children need home meetings.</l><l>(repeat)</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>I need you,</l><l>And you need me, (clap clap clap)</l><l>We’re members of a family.</l><l>(repeat)</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>And God needs us,</l><l>And we need God, (clap clap clap)</l><l>To be His testimony.</l><l>(repeat)</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
